  "correspondence": {
    "en": "Fisher (1930): the additive genetic variance as the variance of the best linear predictor of fitness, and the fundamental theorem; Price (1972) read it through the covariance. Here in counts, with the normal equations cleared of denominators and nothing subtracted. Readings (the AI's): Fisher's theorem is Price's equation read on the best additive predictor.",
    "zh": "Fisher（1930）：加性遗传方差即适合度最佳线性预测量的方差，及基本定理；Price（1972）经协方差读之。此处以计数陈述，正规方程消去分母，不作减法。读法（AI 的）：Fisher 定理即在最佳加性预测量上读出的 Price 方程。"
  },
